## Article 15. Deletion or Destruction of Personal Data

```catala
declaration scope DeletionRules:
  input retentionPeriodExpired content YesNo
  input legalRelationshipTerminated content YesNo
  input ombudsmanOrderIssued content YesNo
  input courtOrderIssued content YesNo
  input collectedIllegally content YesNo
  output mustBeDeleted content YesNo

scope DeletionRules:
  label default_keep definition mustBeDeleted equals No
  
  label deletion_required exception default_keep
  definition mustBeDeleted under condition
    retentionPeriodExpired = Yes
    or legalRelationshipTerminated = Yes
    or ombudsmanOrderIssued = Yes
    or courtOrderIssued = Yes
    or collectedIllegally = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```
